---
description: Operating rules for the agent home repository
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is the agent home for skills, rules, and the project catalog.

- Do not edit `README.md` unless Carson explicitly asks to change the GitHub profile page.
- Keep project code out of this repository. Match work to `repos/catalog.md`.
- Use the route-task skill when a request may belong to an existing project.
- Use the create-repo skill when no catalog entry fits.
- Edit another repository only when it is present in this environment. If it is absent, name the target repository and stop.
